いが、怒ると……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4420","sourceWorkId":"20717","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"先代である真の祖父に仕えていた鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来、鬼は死を迎えた主と共に常世へと赴くが、桔梗は真のサポートをするために加賀見家に留まっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼は人の目には見えず、人知を超えた不可思議な力を持つが、桔梗は特別な個体で特殊能力を持たない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姿も人と見分けがつかないが、怒ると……？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26600"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37ef336bc0ebaeb01a12971c2bafea59ff3d4eb0b06d843143770fb39b544870.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14868cfe9ac4e06594b16f98e6a1f49ee8166729d4acfa6c443e9543fbc0f841.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109758:26600:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22093","characterName":"葵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26601","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109758"},{"characterId":"26601","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"150138"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4421"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22093"},"originalCharacterName":"葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The first demon created by Makoto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her cat ears and tail are unique to her, presumably formed due to Makoto's odd tastes. She was born with the ability to read memories of both people and objects, which is of great help when hunting down clues to crack cases. The only problem with her is that she's a real firecracker, and rather feisty, so she often brings a whole bundle of problems with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22093"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真のためだけに生みだされた最初の鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桔梗と同様に角はなく、代わりに猫耳と尻尾が生えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人や物に宿る思念を読み取るという特殊な力を有し、お役目で大いに活躍する……のだが。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫らしく天真爛漫でわがままな性格をしており、主を主と思わない言動をとるため、たびたび真を困らせる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4421","sourceWorkId":"20717","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真に仕える鬼の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人や物に宿る思念を読み取る特殊な力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目通りの性格で、猫のように自由気ままにマイペース。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寒い時期はこたつの中に引きこもり出てこない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人である真の帰りがいつも遅いのが最近の不満。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4421","sourceWorkId":"22473","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真のためだけに生みだされた最初の鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桔梗と同様に角は無く、代わりに猫耳と尻尾が生えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人や物に宿る思念を読み取るという特殊な力を有し、お役目で大いに活躍する……のだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫らしく天真爛漫でわがままな性格をしており、主を主と思わない言動をとるため、たびたび真を困らせる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26601"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/58ac65f691b515ef2e288a62ed02624d38b5a5b294dada1908fb2094d112862f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf4a40cce89d084800815f92c87fcffcfe4452657abca4f897907b49e7651b10.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109758:26601:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22094","characterName":"芙蓉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"charac