"その影響で、葵のような特殊な力は持っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿が似ていることもあり、やはり芙蓉も怒ると……？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26602"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1baf34d37ff19ac8ec90bc3eb22e51b900c4755403b9afec81ba71e8474e49c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f50d74e88abf4bed83168c681774933c5335f16497a6de6b5e0530117f3bf72.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109758:26602:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22095","characterName":"アイリス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26603","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109758"},{"characterId":"26603","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"150138"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4423"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22095"},"originalCharacterName":"アイリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The third demon created by Makoto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike the other demons, she wears western clothing and always carries around a stuffed toy named Axy. Iris is a telepath, a fact that allows her to link the minds of Makoto and all of his demons in order for them to communicate more easily regardless of distance. However, precisely due to those powers, she has trouble speaking directly to people, so she stutters and stammers quite often in person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22095"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真のためだけに生みだされた三番目の鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の二人と違い洋服を身に纏っており、いつもぬいぐるみの「ウーパくん」を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テレパシー能力を持っており、複数の相手と言葉を声に出すことなく会話が可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり範囲は広くないが、遠くにいる人物にもテレパシーは届く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その能力のためか本人は肉声で喋るのがとても苦手で、普通に話そうととすると激しくどもってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4423","sourceWorkId":"20717","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真に仕える鬼の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テレパシー能力を持ち、肉声で話すのが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼三姉妹の末妹であり、やはり葵よりしっかりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも抱いているぬいぐるみの名前は「ウーパくん」で、アイリスの奴隷らしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4423","sourceWorkId":"22473","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真のためだけに生みだされた三番目の鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の二人と違い洋服を身に纏っており、いつもぬいぐるみの “ウーパくん” を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テレパシー能力を持っており、複数の相手と言葉を声に出すことなく会話が可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり範囲は広くないが、遠くにいる人物にもテレパシーは届く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その能力のためか本人は肉声で喋るのがとても苦手で、普通に話そうととすると激しくどもってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26603"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/2766c3a5f5ffa4f31cc0d26b12683c00e37ca93d3dfe5c6a515eb5555565bf48.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/acdd0683fe20af10f9d97a7625a5a80acfd33bd388a23d487759820c6b176b1a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜咲千依","creatorId":"vndb:s608","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s608","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s608","name":"藤咲ウサ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109758:26603:8990:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22096","characterName":"伏見 梓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26598","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109758"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4418"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22096"},"originalCharacterName":"伏見 梓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A newly promoted detective who Makoto meets due to his new role as head of the Kagami family. The Kagamis have been working with the police for generations, receiving rewards for helping them close cases."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Azusa works for the 13th Division, a branch that specifically deals with supernatural cases, and only began believing in ghosts upon meeting Makoto. Initially thinking she was sent off to a dead branch due to her lack of faith in the paranormal, she now lends her keen insight to the goal of helping wandering spirits move on to the afterlife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22096"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お役目を通して知り合った新米刑事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"加賀見家は少なくとも先代から警察と協力関係にあり、警察から依頼を受け、それを解決することで報酬を得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"梓は加賀見家への依頼――霊関係の事件を専門に取り扱う、刑事十三課に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真と会うまでは霊の存在を信じていなかったため、窓際部署に飛ばされたとかなり腐っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"経験が浅いながらも洞察力が鋭く有能な刑事だが、少々愚痴っぽいのが玉に瑕。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4418","sourceWorkId":"20717","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お役目を通して知り合った新米刑事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"加賀見家は少なくとも先代から警察と協力関係にあり、警察から依頼を受け、それを解決することで報酬を得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"梓は加賀見家への依頼―― 霊関係の事件を専門に取り扱う、刑事十三課に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真と会うまでは霊の存在を信じていなかったため、窓際部署に飛ばされたとかなり腐っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"経験が浅いながらも洞察力が鋭く有能な刑事だが、少々愚痴っぽいのが玉に瑕。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26598"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac45c7d63df2c48d48cf5f73bcfd2bea3a46eba10177640086d48b3388a83889.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wi